$$\lim_{\varepsilon\downarrow0}\sup_{s>0}\|\Lambda_{(\sigma*\rho_\varepsilon-\sigma)_s}\|=0.$$
The same conclusion holds for every permutation of the $L^2\times L^2\times L^\infty$ norm.

